{"severity":"error","file":"errors/arity_mismatch_1.march","start_line":5,"start_col":12,"end_line":5,"end_col":16,"message":"`cb` is a lambda with 1 parameter, but is called with 0 arguments.\nMarch has no partial application — a call must supply all arguments.","code":"arity_mismatch","fix":{"kind":"replace","start_line":4,"start_col":13,"end_line":4,"end_col":17,"text":"fn"},"labels":[{"file":"errors/arity_mismatch_1.march","start_line":4,"start_col":13,"end_line":4,"end_col":23,"message":"bound here with 1 parameter"}],"notes":["`fn _ -> …` takes one argument and ignores it; a zero-argument lambda is written `fn -> …`."]}
